\pard\b\fs20 Burning Depths\b0\par
\fs16\par
During mining work, the lost legendary statue was found again. It was to be recovered, but the statue broke. The curse it released opened a crack in the ground and dragged the statue's parts and some Clonks down into the hellish depths. To break the curse and escape again, the statue has to be repaired. But its parts have sunk deep into the lava floods and can only be recovered with clever methods. For every recovered part, there is support from the surface.\par
\par
The goal of the round is to find and repair the statue. Buildings need power and building materials. Power can only be produced by a power plant.\par
